        <fields>
            <name>txtSemesterHelp</name>
            <fieldText>&lt;p&gt;&lt;em style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 102, 102);&quot;&gt;If evaluation visit dates, or the school report due date was set, the semester defaults to these date(s) accordingly. When no date(s) have yet been recorded yet, or when this does not apply, the semester defaults to the cycle start date. It is not possible to select a semester before the accreditation cycle stage begins.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</fieldText>
